# Talir brand system — non-negotiable in every task

talir.mk is an end-of-day data site for the Macedonian Stock Exchange. Brand: **"The Sovereign" (variant 1A)** — a navy reeded coin with a **gold acorn** at its centre. The acorn coin is the ONLY mark. Never substitute a "T" monogram, a tree, a generic chart icon, or any emoji/icon-font glyph.

## 1. Design tokens (single source of truth — never recolor outside this set)

```css
:root {
  /* Brand palette (raw) */
  --talir-navy:        #0F1F38;
  --talir-navy-2:      #16294A;
  --talir-navy-deep:   #0A1424;
  --talir-navy-alt:    #0B2545;
  --talir-gold:        #C6A24A;
  --talir-gold-bright: #DCC079;
  --talir-gold-soft:   #E7D9A8;
  --talir-ivory:       #F5F2EA;
  --talir-ivory-card:  #FBFAF5;
  --talir-muted:       #5A6577;

  /* Type families */
  --talir-serif: 'Source Serif 4', Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
  --talir-mono:  'IBM Plex Mono', ui-monospace, 'Courier New', monospace;
  --talir-sans:  'Inter', system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif;

  /* Semantic layer — LIGHT (default) */
  --bg:          var(--talir-ivory);
  --surface:     var(--talir-ivory-card);
  --surface-2:   #FFFFFF;
  --text:        var(--talir-navy);
  --text-muted:  var(--talir-muted);
  --accent:      var(--talir-gold);
  --border:      rgba(15, 31, 56, 0.12);
  --up:          #1A7A47;
  --down:        #C2362F;
  --neutral:     var(--talir-muted);
}

/* Semantic layer — DARK (navy, on-brand — NOT near-black) */
:root[data-theme="dark"] {
  --bg:          var(--talir-navy-deep);
  --surface:     var(--talir-navy);
  --surface-2:   var(--talir-navy-2);
  --text:        var(--talir-ivory);
  --text-muted:  #9FB0C9;
  --accent:      var(--talir-gold-bright);
  --border:      rgba(231, 217, 168, 0.14);
  --up:          #54C98C;
  --down:        #F0726A;
  --neutral:     #9FB0C9;
}
```

Rules:
- Components consume ONLY the semantic layer (`var(--bg)`, `var(--up)`, …). Never hard-code a hex in a component; never hard-code green/red.
- Up/down pairs differ per theme for WCAG AA — do not "unify" them.
- 8px spacing system. Radii 8–12px. Hairline borders (`--border`) over heavy boxes/shadows. Shadows only on genuinely floating elements (sheets, menus, modals).

## 2. Typography roles (fixed)

- **Source Serif 4, 700, letter-spacing -0.015em** → wordmark + page/section headings + company names as titles.
- **IBM Plex Mono** → ALL numeric/market data and data labels: prices, % change, volume, index levels, "ден.", ticker symbols, "as of" freshness line, table column labels. Always `font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums`.
- **Inter / system sans** → body and UI text: descriptions, buttons, menus, helper copy.

Type scale: 12 / 14 / 16 / 20 / 28 / 40. Numbers and tickers are the visual heroes of their rows. Self-host all three fonts, subset **Latin + Cyrillic**, `font-display: swap`.

## 3. The logo — complete, final code (no placeholders anywhere)

### 3a. React mark component — `components/TalirMark.tsx`

This is the exact 1A Sovereign geometry. Do not redraw, simplify, stretch, or "improve" the paths.

```tsx
type TalirMarkProps = {
  size?: number;
  disc?: string;   // coin background
  ink?: string;    // reeded edge + acorn
  className?: string;
  title?: string;
};

export function TalirMark({
  size = 40,
  disc = "var(--talir-navy)",
  ink = "var(--talir-gold)",
  className,
  title = "Talir",
}: TalirMarkProps) {
  return (
    <svg
      width={size}
      height={size}
      viewBox="0 0 100 100"
      role="img"
      aria-label={title}
      className={className}
    >
      {/* coin disc */}
      <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="47" fill={disc} />
      {/* reeded (dashed) edge — the signature; always drawn in ink */}
      <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="46" fill="none" stroke={ink} strokeWidth="1.7" strokeDasharray="1.1 2.5" strokeLinecap="round" />
      <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="42.5" fill="none" stroke={ink} strokeWidth="0.9" strokeOpacity="0.85" />
      <circle cx="50" cy="50" r="37" fill="none" stroke={ink} strokeWidth="0.7" strokeOpacity="0.5" />
      {/* acorn cap */}
      <path d="M37 45 C37 37 44 32 50 32 C56 32 63 37 63 45 Z" fill={ink} />
      {/* stem */}
      <line x1="50" y1="32" x2="50" y2="27.5" stroke={ink} strokeWidth="2" strokeLinecap="round" />
      {/* acorn body */}
      <path d="M37 47 C37 60 42 70 50 70 C58 70 63 60 63 47 C58 49 42 49 37 47 Z" fill={ink} />
    </svg>
  );
}
```

Recolor recipe (pass as props — nothing else is permitted):

| Context                  | disc                      | ink                          |
|--------------------------|---------------------------|------------------------------|
| Full colour (on ivory)   | `var(--talir-navy)`       | `var(--talir-gold)`          |
| On navy panel / dark hdr | `transparent`             | `var(--talir-gold-soft)`     |
| Mono dark                | `transparent`             | `var(--talir-navy)`          |
| Mono gold                | `transparent`             | `var(--talir-gold)`          |

Never place the navy disc on a navy background — use the reversed (transparent-disc, gold-soft ink) variant. Never add drop shadows to the mark. Clear space ≥ wordmark cap height.

### 3b. Horizontal lockup — `components/TalirLogo.tsx`

```tsx
import { TalirMark } from "./TalirMark";

export function TalirLogo({ locale = "en" }: { locale?: "en" | "mk" }) {
  const word = locale === "mk" ? "Талир" : "Talir";
  const tag  = locale === "mk" ? "Скопје · Берза" : "Makedonska Berza · Markets";
  return (
    <a className="talir-logo" href="/" aria-label="Talir — Makedonska Berza">
      <TalirMark size={44} className="talir-logo__mark" />
      <span className="talir-logo__text">
        <span className="talir-logo__word">{word}<span className="talir-logo__dot">.</span></span>
        <span className="talir-logo__tag">{tag}</span>
      </span>
    </a>
  );
}
```

```css
.talir-logo { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; text-decoration: none; }
.talir-logo__word {
  font-family: var(--talir-serif); font-weight: 700; font-size: 28px;
  letter-spacing: -0.015em; line-height: 0.9; color: var(--text);
}
.talir-logo__dot { color: var(--accent); }  /* the gold full stop = a coin */
.talir-logo__tag {
  display: block; margin-top: 4px; font-family: var(--talir-mono);
  font-size: 9px; letter-spacing: 0.32em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--text-muted);
}
```

The tagline is EXACTLY `Makedonska Berza · Markets` (Latin) / `Скопје · Берза` (Cyrillic). Any other tagline (e.g. "Skopje · Exchange") is a bug — replace it.

